      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Enable the global actions dialog during LockTask mode. This is the dialog that shows up when the user long-presses the power button, for example. Note that the user may not be able to power off the device if this flag is not set.</para>
          <para>This flag is enabled by default until setLockTaskFeatures(ComponentName,int) is called for the first time.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/DevicePolicyManager#LOCK_TASK_FEATURE_GLOBAL_ACTIONS" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.DevicePolicyManager.LOCK_TASK_FEATURE_GLOBAL_ACTIONS</code>.</a></format></para>
