        <summary>
          <para>Enable the Home button during LockTask mode. Note that if a custom launcher is used, it has to be registered as the default launcher with addPersistentPreferredActivity(ComponentName,IntentFilter,ComponentName), and its package needs to be allowlisted for LockTask with setLockTaskPackages(ComponentName,String[]).</para>
