      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Disable all configurable SystemUI features during LockTask mode. This includes, system info area in the status bar (connectivity icons, clock, etc.); notifications (including alerts, icons, and the notification shade); Home button; Recents button and UI; global actions menu (i.e. power button menu); keyguard</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/app/admin/DevicePolicyManager#LOCK_TASK_FEATURE_NONE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.app.admin.DevicePolicyManager.LOCK_TASK_FEATURE_NONE</code>.</a></format></para>
